Designed with community in mind.
For Mill Village Ministries in Greenville, SW+ provided civil and landscape design services pro bono for the renovation and infill of a space now serving multiple community needs, including a bike repair shop, foodshare operations, community services, and event space. 
The project also brought the challenge of creating a welcoming pedestrian area while accommodating the parking and truck access needed to keep everything moving. 

